{"3776790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Enchanted Stories: PAWisoned Kingdom Collector's Edition", "steam_appid": 3776790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3777380], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776790/extras/f71e4d27d4fdfa78f00ce4a9300cfbb7.avif?t=1761667186\" width=600 height=280 /></span>Step into the world of Hidden Object Puzzle Adventures! This genre blends story-driven gameplay with interactive point-and-click exploration. You’ll carefully examine beautifully detailed scenes, searching for cleverly concealed items from a list. Along the way, you’ll also encounter brain-teasing puzzles and mini-games that test your logic, perception, and problem-solving skills. Each scene is both a challenge and a piece of the unfolding story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776790/extras/6cc3e53e362dfa0d4186b08ce06b8908.poster.avif?t=1761667186\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776790/extras/6cc3e53e362dfa0d4186b08ce06b8908.webm?t=1761667186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776790/extras/6cc3e53e362dfa0d4186b08ce06b8908.mp4?t=1761667186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The great feline realm of Castelia faces its darkest hour: King Leonard III lies stricken by a mysterious illness, and whispers of betrayal echo through the palace halls. Felicia, the king’s fearless protector, must join forces with Diego, a roguish truthseeker, to unmask a deadly conspiracy. From grand corridors to secret alleyways, the two must navigate deception, disguise, and danger to save not only the monarch—but the fragile peace between cats and humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a variety of challenges, from classic hidden object scenes to inventive mini-games. Every puzzle brings you closer to the truth while offering fresh ways to test your wits and observation skills.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776790/extras/1352cdb7cf2d4a94ead2a93b11e19835.poster.avif?t=1761667186\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776790/extras/1352cdb7cf2d4a94ead2a93b11e19835.webm?t=1761667186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776790/extras/1352cdb7cf2d4a94ead2a93b11e19835.mp4?t=1761667186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ Explore a vibrant fantasy world: from shadowy corridors to smoky inns and moonlit rooftops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ Search for Hidden Objects and collectible items to unravel the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ Solve dozens of puzzles, tricky brain teasers, and unique mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ Gather hidden treasures and unlock special achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ Untangle royal secrets and treacherous plots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ Enjoy charming artwork, enchanting wallpapers, and a captivating soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth, protect the throne, and save Castelia before it’s too late!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776790/extras/f71e4d27d4fdfa78f00ce4a9300cfbb7.avif?t=1761667186\" width=600 height=280 /></span>Step into the world of Hidden Object Puzzle Adventures! This genre blends story-driven gameplay with interactive point-and-click exploration. You’ll carefully examine beautifully detailed scenes, searching for cleverly concealed items from a list. Along the way, you’ll also encounter brain-teasing puzzles and mini-games that test your logic, perception, and problem-solving skills. Each scene is both a challenge and a piece of the unfolding story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776790/extras/6cc3e53e362dfa0d4186b08ce06b8908.poster.avif?t=1761667186\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776790/extras/6cc3e53e362dfa0d4186b08ce06b8908.webm?t=1761667186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776790/extras/6cc3e53e362dfa0d4186b08ce06b8908.mp4?t=1761667186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The great feline realm of Castelia faces its darkest hour: King Leonard III lies stricken by a mysterious illness, and whispers of betrayal echo through the palace halls. Felicia, the king’s fearless protector, must join forces with Diego, a roguish truthseeker, to unmask a deadly conspiracy. From grand corridors to secret alleyways, the two must navigate deception, disguise, and danger to save not only the monarch—but the fragile peace between cats and humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a variety of challenges, from classic hidden object scenes to inventive mini-games. Every puzzle brings you closer to the truth while offering fresh ways to test your wits and observation skills.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.ak